>MbhC
yat te māṃsāni gātrebhya uktṛttāni viśāṃ pate | eṣā te bhāsvarī kīrtir lokān abhibhaviṣyati || 29
>MbhS
yat te māṃsāni gātrebhyas_ samutkṛttāni pārthiva | eṣā te śāśvatī kīrtir_ lokān abhibhaviṣyati || 30 ||
